lickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[55,324][1385,2872]"><node index="0" text="" resource-id="" class="android.view.ViewGroup" package="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[55,360][1385,2872]"><node index="0" text="1" resource-id="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender:id/counterTv" class="android.widget.TextView" package="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[91,396][203,508]" /><node index="1" text="بِسْمِ اللَّهِ وَالْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، سُبْحَانَ الَّذِي سَخَّرَ لَناَ هَذَا وَمَا كُنَّا لَهُ مُقْرِنِينَ، وَإِنَّا إِلَى رَبِّنَا لَمُنْقَلِبُونَ، الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ، اللَّهُ أكْبَرُ، اللَّهُ أكْبَرُ، اللَّهُ أكْبَرُ، سُبْحَانَكَ اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي ظَلَمْتُ نَفْسِي فَاغْفِرْ لِي، فَإِنَّهُ لاَ يَغْفِرُ الذُّنُوبَ إِلَاَّ أَنْتَ" resource-id="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender:id/item_dua" class="android.widget.TextView" package="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[91,544][1349,1100]" /><node index="2" text="Bismillaah , Alhamdu lillaah . Subhaanal-lathee sakhkhara lanaa haathaa wa maa kunnaa lahu muqrineen. Wa 'innaa 'ilaa Rabbinaa lamunqaliboon . Alhamdu lillaah, alhamdu lillaah, alhamdu lillaah, Allaahu 'Akbar, Allaahu 'Akbar, Allaahu 'Akbar, subhaanakal-laahumma 'innee dhalamtu nafsee faghfir lee, fa'innahu laa yaghfiruth-thunooba 'illaa 'Anta." resource-id="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender:id/item_dua_roman" class="android.widget.TextView" package="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[91,1136][1349,2055]" /><node index="3" text="In the Name of Allah and all praise is due to Allah. Glory be to Him Who has subjected this for us, though we could never have subdued it by ourselves. Indeed, to our Lord we shall return. All praise is due to Allah, all praise is due to Allah, all praise is due to Allah. Allah is the Greatest, Allah is the Greatest, Allah is the Greatest. Glory be to You, O Allah, indeed I have wronged myself, so forgive me, for none forgives sins except You." resource-id="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender:id/item_dua_translation" class="android.widget.TextView" package="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[91,2091][1349,2713]" /><node index="4" text="Reference: Abu Dawud 3/34, Sahih At-Tirmizi 5/501" resource-id="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender:id/item_dua_reference" class="android.widget.TextView" package="prayertime.compassdirection.qiblafinder.hijricalender" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[91,2749][1349,2839]" /></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></node></hierarchy>